# Everything the build does not need.
#
# Without this the whole directory is sent to the daemon — 218MB of it, almost
# all node_modules, which is then thrown away because the image installs its
# own. The build also gets slower every time you run it locally.

node_modules
dist
.git
.gitignore
.DS_Store
*.log
npm-debug.log*
.env
.env.*
.vscode
.idea
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
README.md
